{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"liusima-e-o195","title":"刘类苛虐属吏，捽头乱杖，牵出复入","accounts":[{"id":"liusima-a-7e83aa58bf88e92498ce","label":"裴注·魏略·苛吏传","text":"刘类苛虐属吏，捽头乱杖，牵出复入","evidence":["liusima-q-5ab5c9492ce41730c2ae"]},{"id":"liusima-a-58ace5982fc238481bfc","label":"裴注·魏略·苛吏传","text":"刘类使人掘地求钱，市里皆有孔穴","evidence":["liusima-q-0a2f6437849f19ad4570"]},{"id":"liusima-a-e90ba6b645c0aee90cfd","label":"裴注·魏略·苛吏传","text":"刘类外托简省阴识不修礼敬者，多遣覆察转相检验","evidence":["liusima-q-24445d3251ce60bd4484"]},{"id":"liusima-a-555b21dc5528830ffd46","label":"裴注·魏略·苛吏传","text":"刘类宿民家误责五官掾孙弼","evidence":["liusima-q-8338e3746c18405a3ccc"]},{"id":"liusima-a-bb0fe5bff47b74317e73","label":"裴注·魏略·苛吏传","text":"民尹昌年垂百岁儿扶迎府君，刘类呵其儿","evidence":["liusima-q-ce35cf08c792cc6301ad"]},{"id":"liusima-a-fcfe34291bf39dbdcf86","label":"裴注·魏略·苛吏传","text":"弘农吏民题刘类门曰刘府君有三不肯，类不能自改","evidence":["liusima-q-503ae1ce4cf8cad7008a"]},{"id":"liusima-a-855011eb43c8a5b5f116","label":"裴注·魏略·苛吏传","text":"司马文王西征路经弘农，弘农人告刘类荒耄，召入为五官中郎将","evidence":["liusima-q-ec2f0ee026b774b187a1"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liusima-p0008","role":"吏二百余人不与休假，专使为不急；过无轻重辄捽其头，又乱杖挝之，牵出复入如是数四；使人掘地求钱，所在市里皆有孔穴；每出行阳敕督邮不得使官属曲修礼敬，而阴识不来者辄发怒中伤之；每遣大吏出辄使小吏随覆察之，白日常自于墙壁间窥闪，夜使干廉察诸曹，复以干不足信又遣铃下及奴婢转相检验；案行宿止民家，民家二狗逐猪、猪惊走头插栅间号呼良久，类以为外之吏擅共饮食，不复征察，便使伍百曳五官掾孙弼入顿头责之；弼以实对，类自愧不详，因托问以他事；望见呵其儿曰用是死人使来见我，其视人无礼皆此类；虽闻之犹不能自改；被告，乃召入为五官中郎将","evidence":["liusima-q-5ab5c9492ce41730c2ae","liusima-q-0a2f6437849f19ad4570","liusima-q-24445d3251ce60bd4484","liusima-q-8338e3746c18405a3ccc","liusima-q-ce35cf08c792cc6301ad","liusima-q-503ae1ce4cf8cad7008a","liusima-q-ec2f0ee026b774b187a1"]},{"person":"liusima-p0020","role":"五官掾，被曳入顿头责之，以实对","evidence":["liusima-q-8338e3746c18405a3ccc"]},{"person":"liusima-p0021","role":"民，年垂百岁，闻类出行谓其儿扶我迎府君我欲陈恩，儿扶昌在道左","evidence":["liusima-q-ce35cf08c792cc6301ad"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0045","role":"安东将军（司马文王），西征路经弘农","evidence":["liusima-q-ec2f0ee026b774b187a1"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liusima-q-5ab5c9492ce41730c2ae","liusima-q-0a2f6437849f19ad4570","liusima-q-24445d3251ce60bd4484","liusima-q-8338e3746c18405a3ccc","liusima-q-ce35cf08c792cc6301ad","liusima-q-503ae1ce4cf8cad7008a","liusima-q-ec2f0ee026b774b187a1"]},"ordering_evidence":"liusima-q-5ab5c9492ce41730c2ae","source_order":[15,136,338],"order":3284}],"persons":[{"id":"liusima-p0021","name":"尹昌","evidence":["liusima-q-ce35cf08c792cc6301ad"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liusima-q-0a2f6437849f19ad4570","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-bb200ef69e2cdfce863a","layer":"pei","quote":"乃使人掘地求钱，所在市里，皆有孔穴","attribution":"裴注·魏略·苛吏传","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":135,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0c093becb80c15c165cb","start":381,"end":398,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-24445d3251ce60bd4484","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-bb200ef69e2cdfce863a","layer":"pei","quote":"又外托简省，每出行，阳敕督邮：不得使官属曲修礼敬；而阴识不来者，辄发怒中伤之。性又少信，每遣大吏出，辄使小吏随覆察之。白日常自于墙壁间窥闪，夜使干，廉察诸曹；复以干不足信，又遣铃下及奴婢使转相检验","attribution":"裴注·魏略·苛吏传","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":135,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0c093becb80c15c165cb","start":399,"end":497,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-503ae1ce4cf8cad7008a","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-bb200ef69e2cdfce863a","layer":"pei","quote":"类在弘农，吏民患之，乃题其门曰：‘刘府君有三不肯。’类虽闻之，犹不能自改","attribution":"裴注·魏略·苛吏传","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":135,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0c093becb80c15c165cb","start":679,"end":715,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-5ab5c9492ce41730c2ae","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-bb200ef69e2cdfce863a","layer":"pei","quote":"吏二百余人，不与休假，专使为不急。过无轻重，辄捽其头；又乱杖挝之，牵出复入，如是数四","attribution":"裴注·魏略·苛吏传","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":135,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0c093becb80c15c165cb","start":338,"end":380,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-8338e3746c18405a3ccc","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-bb200ef69e2cdfce863a","layer":"pei","quote":"尝案行，宿止民家。民家二狗逐猪，猪惊走，头插栅间，号呼良久；类以为外之吏，擅共饮食，不复征察，便使伍百曳五官掾孙弼入，顿头责之。弼以实对，类自愧不详，因托问以他事","attribution":"裴注·魏略·苛吏传","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":135,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0c093becb80c15c165cb","start":498,"end":579,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-ce35cf08c792cc6301ad","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-bb200ef69e2cdfce863a","layer":"pei","quote":"民尹昌，年垂百岁。闻类出行，当经过，谓其儿曰：‘扶我迎府君，我欲陈恩。’儿扶昌，在道左；类望见，呵其儿曰：‘用是死人，使来见我","attribution":"裴注·魏略·苛吏传","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":135,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0c093becb80c15c165cb","start":580,"end":643,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-ec2f0ee026b774b187a1","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-bb200ef69e2cdfce863a","layer":"pei","quote":"其后安东将军司马文王西征，路经弘农。弘农人告类荒耄，不任宰郡；乃召入为五官中郎将","attribution":"裴注·魏略·苛吏传","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":135,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0c093becb80c15c165cb","start":716,"end":756,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
